<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-22T00:32:07.809Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:32:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican special forces captured cartel leader El Chapo Isidro in northern Sinaloa after a bloody firefight that left 11 dead, sparking gun battles, vehicle burnings and gunshots that disrupted a local baseball match. The raid has triggered renewed violence linked to the Sinaloa cartel and heightened migrant caravan movements toward the U.S. border. This capture follows a pattern of high-profile arrests but adds immediate armed clashes in the area. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOa2RiNXlYT1VFSmc3cEJmU0N4QW9Ydk9rX1RBZ3hvakVOYWtIa1ZDdGlhVm8wSUp5MUk2bWg0TFNyc2lvN3VXazhaamp3WTZBOVpqXzBPcnV5OVVGREVtU1FNVDBXb2d2ck5mVmhybmptaUtCMGRJNEt0UGhxU25fM0JWZE5NSUF2NmRxZVlZOGJSaUpncmt6dnFkNEpDdG9ZejlidXU5RnJUdm8?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPZ3ZrbUhDcHRheWFRRDhZWFVhYng0UElSUTdKT3lPSzc1c3o5RG5nRHc0ZjJTQjNLZ2cyNWtKRzhub2VLckVvSWRRZy1aWEpRaEVCUmNIeFVZVlUxYmVsVHg1ZEgxQ000V1ptV19FQTRpSUJhcHRnNUdvZndxMnlvelp5T3MzckRTNEI4?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPZHBDbG9GYkxsaWpTYlVjUlZpYzJlcmI4SHI5VzFWVGJyd3U5NUlwcUxGNzFrelVYODMwSDgwaERhRHhWV2U4VDgxY3B5V1ZkMk9UQUp6ckk1b0Y1Ml92dUIyWTdBUXZJUkxOU3BmY21CXzRnMXZ1WjR4bmRobW1QZmdiMzNtZ2xSNTRYcmVsV2dHdk5NeTA3OV9uV25jc1p3eWphX0ZuakgwSkQtMHNnVFhycw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQQnJSMERqdENGQlNBMVRtemJ1STE4WmRsM0ZKcjA3NFdJdHBaakV5RjNrZ3Y0RXVRb25kZHFfeHk0RDlUSXFSOWdxNzJ2RFNXSU4wbUhEMllVN0pqODh2Z2FLemZkYWduZlZMUldMclhZUi0wUTJteFNpbWY5Z2k5aU1lYjB0VWJUellfbzZEX2NvRk1qZE9SbERnUE9lU3VrT3VfTkZ3MXRpRHdsbVo2UFU3QUpKUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news